OL,3,AWhy so much love between Ireland and
OL,4,AGarth Brooks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans of Garth Brooks will be brushing
OL,7,Foff their Stetsons and polishing their
OL,8,Fcowboy boots after the country music
OL,9,Fsuperstar announced he will be
OL,10,Fperforming in multiple cities across
OL,11,FIreland in 2027.
OL,13,FThe tour includes Belfast, Galway,
OL,14,FKilkenny, Limerick and Cork and will be
OL,15,Fthe first time he has played in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland since his King's Hall
OL,17,Fgig in November 1998.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
