OL,3,AWhy so much love between Ireland and
OL,4,AGarth Brooks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe singer has said in the past that
OL,7,FIreland is his favourite place in the
OL,8,Fworld to sing, and the love appears to
OL,9,Fbe mutual as his first two Belfast
OL,10,Fconcerts sold out, with an extra date
OL,11,Falready added.
OL,13,FSo why has an American country music
OL,14,Fstar remained so popular with Irish
OL,15,Ffans for so many years?
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
